# Moby-Dick oracle batch 05 (public domain, Melville d. 1891).
# Verb-morphology distillation (~226 tok): 3sg -s verbs, imperatives,
# bare/base contrasts, passive vs attributive participles. Ch.32-37,
# disjoint from evals (moby/genre/hard) and oracle 01-04.
# Hand-tagged EWT-side per CANONICAL.md (touching VERB 2:0,
# -able ADJ 308:8, yonder DET by guideline, relative-that PRON,
# generic plural Emperors/Kings NOUN, Captain NOUN by in-repo
# lawyer-precedent over 2:1 tiny EWT).
